        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.3</title>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New in 1.0.3</h2><ul><li>Added local Parakeet V3 transcription using FluidAudio/CoreML.</li><li>Added in-flow model download prompts for Whisper and Parakeet when a required local model is missing.</li><li>Added a true raw Transcript template with no post-processing.</li><li>Moved the previous cleaned transcript behavior to Clean output for Lifetime users.</li><li>Improved microphone permission detection on newer macOS versions.</li></ul>
            ]]></description>
            <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 14:42:51 -0700</pubDate>
